      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4897,
        "name": "原初的那一位",
        "desc": "<p>第一位降临者，击败了世间的七位龙王，并创造了人类。原初的那一位或许便是「法涅斯」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_3593056138001658182.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "原初的那一位创造了若娜瓦。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7086,
        "name": "影子",
        "desc": "<p>原初的那一位创造了四个影子。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/10/326985891/8b241f427d65c3fd1d2768bb70d7f511_6580301444073142171.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "若娜瓦是四个影子之一。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7073,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在若娜瓦的指引下，夜神在纳塔建立了夜神之国。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7074,
        "name": "希巴拉克",
        "desc": "<p>曾击败「焰主」，并于烈焰中复活的初代火神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/01/326985891/e7f7eee058f60fc225b1f5bc654a08e0_644236905823485778.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "若娜瓦将力量赋予了初代火神。凭借这些力量，纳塔的规则得以确立：还魂诗和归火圣夜巡礼。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7299,
        "name": "玛薇卡",
        "desc": "纳塔的领袖，继承「基扬戈兹」之古名，誓以圣火为战争国度照亮未来。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/12/30/2f098b1f15854fd9dafc54998795a59e_864981592196815761.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "最后一代火神运用神座与若娜瓦的力量与深渊展开对抗。而使用这位死之执政力量的代价，便是死亡。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7417,
        "name": "卡皮塔诺",
        "desc": "<p>愚人众十一执行官的首席「队长」，曾是坎瑞亚的「天柱骑士」。原名瑟雷恩。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/31/317661877/1a328d36a9cee6e5e2f7918ecb8d3637_5709802031546899812.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "死之执政向坎瑞亚人降下了不死诅咒，其中便包括「天柱骑士」。「队长」因使用了若娜瓦的力量，选择牺牲自己而非玛薇卡。他想利用这位影子执政的规则来对抗她。而为了维系这份不死诅咒，死之执政不得不放弃了对“死亡”这一代价的索求。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "「死之执政」若娜瓦"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/08/326985891/2e80aed4d6ebac4eb880311a4a357409_7603960841922374954.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月9日</color>\n「唉…好了，我准备宣告这个空间的『死亡』咯？」"
      }
    ],
